d!\n##### One Off Cleaning\n\n[One Off Cleaning](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/one-off-cleaning/)\n\nOur one off cleaning service is ideal for catching up on spring cleaning or sprucing a specific area in your home. Have your home sparkling again with a thorough clean.\n\n[Learn More](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/one-off-cleaning/)\n##### Regular Cleaning\n\n[Regular Cleaning](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/regular-cleaning/)\n\nOur experienced and professional cleaners will work with you to create a tailored cleaning plan that fits your needs and schedule, with thorough cleans every time.\n\n[Learn More](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/regular-cleaning/)\n##### Disinfectant Cleaning\n\n[Disinfectant Cleaning](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/regular-cleaning/)\n\nThis service is designed to kill germs and bacteria, using products more effective at killing viruses such as COVID-19. making your home or office safe and clean.\n\n[Learn More](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/disinfectant/)\n##### End of Lease Cleans\n\n[End of Lease Cleans](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/end-of-lease-cleaning/)\n\nOur professional cleaners will work hard to get your rental property looking its best, ticking off all the essentials. We also offer a 100% Bond Back Guarantee.\n\n[Learn More](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/end-of-lease-cleaning/)\n##### Office Cleaning\n\n[Office Cleaning](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/office-cleaning/)\n\nWe offer a low maintenance and flexible office cleaning service, working diligently to ensure your office is clean and presentable at all times.\n\n[Learn More](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/office-cleaning/)\n##### Steam and Carpet Cleaning\n\n[Steam and Carpet Cleaning](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/carpet-cleaning-and-steam-cleaning/)\n\nKeep your carpets and upholstery looking and smelling fresh with our steam and carpet cleaning services, perfect for high traffic areas in your home.\n\n[Learn More](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/services/carpet-cleaning-and-steam-cleaning/)\n\nWe were born to clean. We’re just wired that way. There’s nothing we like better than getting stuck in to a dirty home and making it sparkle again.\n\nIn fact, we love what we do so much we revolutionised the way you book your house cleaning in Melbourne. We were the first local company to introduce a high-tech online booking platform, so we know what we’re doing and we’re always looking to improve.\n### We Now Offer Exterior Cleaning - Get 25% Off We’re thrilled to announce our acquisition of Exterior Clean Melbourne – a leading provider in Exterior Building Cleaning. We now off all types of exterior building cleaning, such as house washing, roof cleaning, gutter cleaning, driveway cleaning and much more. For a limited time, Maid to Clean Customers can get 25% Off any exterior cleaning service, simply fill in your details via the form below!\n\nWe’re thrilled to announce our acquisition of Exterior Clean Melbourne – a leading provider in Exterior Building Cleaning. We now off all types of exterior building cleaning, such as house washing, roof cleaning, gutter cleaning, driveway cleaning and much more.\n\nFor a limited time, Maid to Clean Customers can get 25% Off any exterior cleaning service, simply fill in your details via the form below!\n\nMOST POPULAR\n\nRegular Cleaning\n\n$71 /hr\n\nOur experienced and professional cleaners will work with you to create a tailored cleaning plan that fits your needs and schedule, with thorough cleans every time.\n\nHourly or Flat rates\n\nDiscounts for Regular Services\n\nConsistent Cleaning Team each Service\n\nProfessional, Police Checks and Insured\n\nAll Equipment and Supplies Provided\n\nOne Off Cleaning\n\n$179 +\n\nNeed a one-time refresh? Our one-off cleaning service is perfect for touch ups, spring cleans, special occasions or just getting back on top of things. We’ll leave your home spotless, so you can relax and spend time on the important stuff.\n\nSmall Touch Ups or Full Home Cleans\n\nExtras Like Oven, Fridge, Carpet Cleaning and more\n\nAll Equipment and Supplies Provides\n\nMost Popular\n\nEnd Of Lease Cleaning\n\nMoving out? Let us take the stress out of your end-of-lease clean. Our expert team follows agency-approved checklists to help ensure your bond comes back where it belongs - in your pocket.\n\n100% Bond Back Guarantee\n\n20% Off - Limited Time Only\n\nHonest and Transparent Pricing\n\nTailored to Rental Agents Inspections\n##### Spotless Results, Every Time\n\n96% of our clients are thrilled with their cleans. With such high expectations across Melbourne, we're proud to consistently deliver the spotless results our clients know and trust.\n##### Reliable Service\n\nWith a 96.5% success rate, our seamless processes ensure your clean stays on schedule—dependable, efficient, and hassle-free.\n##### Professionalism You Can Trust\n\n97.5% of cleans are carried out with complete professionalism, following our trusted policies and procedures. You can feel confident knowing your space is in reliable, respectful hands every time.\n### Recently featured on FOX 101.9 Maid to Clean was recently featured on Fifi, Fev & Nick’s show on Fox 101.9. We worked with Fox to give one lucky winner free fortnightly house cleaning for the rest of the year! A big congratulations to Tracey from Craigieburn!\n\nMaid to Clean was recently featured on Fifi, Fev & Nick’s show on Fox 101.9. We worked with Fox to give one lucky winner free fortnightly house cleaning for the rest of the year!\n\nA big congratulations to Tracey from Craigieburn!\n### How to clean your house in under a minute\n\nor flat rate service\n\n1. Chose an hourly\n\n2. Pop your details in\n\nand click 'Book Now'\n\n3. Put your feet up...\n\nWe'll take it from there\n#### Dharti and Kishan\nGeelong\n\nJune 2026\n\nDharti and Kishan are our platinum team, and that title says everything about the standard they set. Since joining Maid to Clean Melbourne in 2023, they have shown time and time again that we can count on them in any situation, and that kind of trust is not something we hand out lightly.\n#### Meet your perfect cleaning team\n\nWe want you to be delighted with your clean every time. We know the secret to a great service is perfectly matching you with a cleaning team who understands your needs.\n\nThat’s why we’ve hand-picked every one of our cleaning teams. We only choose those with extensive cleaning experience, a professional, can-do attitude and a passion for cleaning. They’ve got to be a bit fun and friendly, too.\n\nMelbourne's Premium Home Cleaning Service\n##### Know what your costs are\n\nTake back control of your cleaning budget. Choose what suits you best – a time-based hourly rate service or a results-based flat rate. We also offer a range of specialist services.\n\n[See Pricing](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/pricing/)\n##### Book your next clean in 60 secs\n\nOur streamlined online booking system makes your life a breeze. Just click Book Now and we’ll take it from there. Need an emergency clean up done super-fast? Just call. We’re here for you.\n\n[Book Now](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/book-now/)\n##### We only employ the very best\n\nOur premium Melbourne cleaning teams are at the top of their game and they really love to clean. But if you’re not completely satisfied, check out our 200% satisfaction guarantee.\n\n[Our Teams](https://www.maidtoclean.com.au/who-we-are/)\n#### 200% Satisfaction Guarantee\n\nIf you’re not happy enough to recommend us to your friends, let us know and we’ll send a team out to make it right. Still not thrilled? Get up to a full refund. Because that’s how we roll.\n\nT&Cs apply - Please see your booking confirmation for more info.\n### Hi. My name’s Ed.\n\nI’m an English engineer who fell in love with Melbourne while studying abroad and decided to call it home permanently in 2013. My parents always nurtured two things in me – an entrepreneurial spirit and the importance of a good work ethic. I’ve taken both these lessons to heart and integrated them in to the business ethos at Maid to Clean.\n\nMaid to Clean was established with a single objective in mind – to help busy people create “me-time” by helping them to book a high-quality professional clean at the right price, when they need it most.\n\nI streamlined our website, junked all the laborious ‘obligation-free quote’ palaver, put our costs upfront, and stripped away all the smoke and mirrors. I didn’t reduce our services to the usual lowest common denominator – the cheapest price possible. Instead, we compete on a value for money proposition by giving you the best quality, most meticulous service possible at reasonable rates.\n\nNow booking a cleaner you can rely on is simplicity itself.\n\nGo on. Give us a try today.\n"
